# Scheduling / optimization
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# We keep the mathematical algorithm identical and apply only semantics-preserving
# loop transformations to improve locality and expose more structure to the
# backend compiler (e.g., enabling better vectorization of the i-loops).
#
